{"book":"zhongyong","id":"sishu.zhongyong.29","index":29,"passages":[{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.29.01","number":1,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"wáng","traditional":"王","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xià","traditional":"下","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"sān","traditional":"三","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhòng","traditional":"重","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yān","traditional":"焉","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"guǎ","traditional":"寡","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"过","pinyin":"guò","traditional":"過","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"矣","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hū","traditional":"乎","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"！"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Orang yang memerintah dunia, baginya ada tiga hal yang perlu diperhatikan agar dapat mengurangi kesalahan (tentang kebajikan, kedudukan dan waktu)."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.29.02","number":2,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"shàng","traditional":"上","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yān","traditional":"焉","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"虽","pinyin":"suī","traditional":"雖","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shàn","traditional":"善","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"征","pinyin":"zhǐ","traditional":"徵","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"征","pinyin":"zhǐ","traditional":"徵","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xìn","traditional":"信","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xìn","traditional":"信","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"mín","traditional":"民","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fú","traditional":"弗","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"从","pinyin":"cóng","traditional":"從","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"xià","traditional":"下","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yān","traditional":"焉","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"虽","pinyin":"suī","traditional":"雖","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shàn","traditional":"善","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zūn","traditional":"尊","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zūn","traditional":"尊","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xìn","traditional":"信","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xìn","traditional":"信","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"mín","traditional":"民","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fú","traditional":"弗","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"从","pinyin":"cóng","traditional":"從","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Betapapun baik peraturan yang dibuat orang besar jaman dahulu itu, tetapi sudah tidak ada kenyataannya lagi. Karena sudah tidak ada kenyataannya lagi, maka tidak mendapatkan kepercayaan. Karena tidak mendapatkan kepercayaan maka rakyatpun tidak mau mengikutinya. Betapapun baik peraturan yang dibuat orang yang berkedudukan rendah, ternyata tidak mendapat penghormatan. Karena tidak mendapat penghormatan maka tidak mendapatkan kepercayaan. Karena tidak mendapatkan kepercayaan, maka rakyatpun tidak mau mengikutinya."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.29.03","number":3,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"故","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"běn","traditional":"本","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"诸","pinyin":"zhū","traditional":"諸","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shēn","traditional":"身","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"征","pinyin":"zhǐ","traditional":"徵","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"诸","pinyin":"zhū","traditional":"諸","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shù","traditional":"庶","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mín","traditional":"民","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"kǎo","traditional":"考","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"诸","pinyin":"zhū","traditional":"諸","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"sān","traditional":"三","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wáng","traditional":"王","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"缪","pinyin":"móu","traditional":"繆","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"jiàn","traditional":"建","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"诸","pinyin":"zhū","traditional":"諸","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dì","traditional":"地","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bèi","traditional":"悖","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"modern":"质","pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"質","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"诸","pinyin":"zhū","traditional":"諸","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"guǐ","traditional":"鬼","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shén","traditional":"神","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yí","traditional":"疑","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bǎi","traditional":"百","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shì","traditional":"世","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"俟","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"圣","pinyin":"shèng","traditional":"聖","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"人","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"huò","traditional":"惑","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Maka Jalan Suci seorang Junzi - Kuncu menuntut diri sendiri sebagai pokok. Dinyatakan itu kepada rakyat banyak; diujikan itu kepada hukum Tiga Raja yang lalu itu, agar tiada kesalahan; ditegakkan diantara langit dan bumi sampai tidak berlanggaran; dan, dinyatakan itu ke hadapan Tuhan Yang Maha Rokh sehingga tiada keraguan. Maka walaupun harus menunggu beratus jaman serta munculnya seorang Nabi baharu, tidak merasa was-was. (Bc. IIA:2.17)."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.29.04","number":4,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"modern":"质","pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"質","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"诸","pinyin":"zhū","traditional":"諸","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"guǐ","traditional":"鬼","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shén","traditional":"神","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yí","traditional":"疑","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"知","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"bǎi","traditional":"百","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shì","traditional":"世","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"俟","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"圣","pinyin":"shèng","traditional":"聖","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"人","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"huò","traditional":"惑","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"知","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"人","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Dinyatakan itu ke hadapan Tuhan Yang Maha Rokh sehingga tiada keraguan; itu menunjukkan ia mengenal Tuhan. Walaupun harus menunggu beratus jaman hingga munculnya seorang Nabi baharu, tidak merasa was-was; itu menunjukkan bahwa ia mengenal manusia. (T.S. XIX: 7)."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.29.05","number":5,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"shì","traditional":"是","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"故","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"动","pinyin":"dòng","traditional":"動","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shì","traditional":"世","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"为","pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"為","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xià","traditional":"下","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"xíng","traditional":"行","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shì","traditional":"世","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"为","pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"為","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xià","traditional":"下","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fǎ","traditional":"法","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"yán","traditional":"言","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shì","traditional":"世","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"为","pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"為","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xià","traditional":"下","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"则","pinyin":"zé","traditional":"則","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"modern":"远","pinyin":"yuǎn","traditional":"遠","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"则","pinyin":"zé","traditional":"則","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wàng","traditional":"望","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"pinyin":"jìn","traditional":"近","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"则","pinyin":"zé","traditional":"則","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"厌","pinyin":"yàn","traditional":"厭","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Maka, seorang Junzi - Kuncu itu segenap gerakannya turun temurun akan menjadi Jalan Suci bagi dunia; perbuatannya turun temurun akan menjadi contoh hukum di dunia; dan, kata-katanya turun temurun akan menjadi pedoman bagi dunia. Maka yang jauh akan mengharapkan dan yang dekat tidak merasa jemu."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.29.06","number":6,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"modern":"诗","pinyin":"shī","traditional":"詩","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"pinyin":"zài","traditional":"在","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bǐ","traditional":"彼","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"恶","pinyin":"è","traditional":"惡","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"zài","traditional":"在","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"cǐ","traditional":"此","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shè","traditional":"射","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"pinyin":"shù","traditional":"庶","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"几","pinyin":"jǐ","traditional":"幾","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"sù","traditional":"夙","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yè","traditional":"夜","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǒng","traditional":"永","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"终","pinyin":"zhōng","traditional":"終","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"誉","pinyin":"yù","traditional":"譽","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。”"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"未","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rú","traditional":"如","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"cǐ","traditional":"此","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǎo","traditional":"蚤","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"誉","pinyin":"yù","traditional":"譽","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"于","pinyin":"yú","traditional":"於","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xià","traditional":"下","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Di dalam Kitab Sanjak tertulis, 'Di sana tiada yang membenci, di sini tiada yang menyesali, siang malam tak pernah lalai; maka, diperoleh pujian sepanjang masa tanpa berkesudahan'. Belum pernah ada seorang Junzi - Kuncu yang tidak demikian dapat segera memperoleh pujian di dunia ini. (IV. IB.3.2). TENGAH SEMPURNA BAB XXIX (Nabi Penerus dan Penyempurna)"}],"source_file":"02 - Zhong Yong 中庸/29 - Bab XXVIII - Hukum Yang di Dalam Jalan Suci.md","title":"Bab XXVIII — Hukum Yang di Dalam Jalan Suci"}
